OL,3,AStorm Boelo amber warnings kick in as
OL,4,Aparts of UK brace for 80mph gusts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe second named storm in as many days
OL,7,Fcomes as National Grid continues to
OL,8,Frestore power to thousands of
OL,9,Fproperties in south-west England after
OL,10,Fthe area was hit hardest by Storm
OL,11,FAusten.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
