OL,3,ABurnham open to 'honest discussion' on
OL,4,AEU free movement
OL,5,
OL,6,FShadow home secretary Chris Philp said
OL,7,Fthere could be "no return" to free
OL,8,Fmovement after the 2016 EU referendum,
OL,9,Fwhile Reform UK leader Nigel Farage
OL,10,Fsaid the prime minister's comments were
OL,11,Fa betrayal of voters who supported
OL,12,FBrexit.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
